The fix follows checks-effects-interactions: validate inputs, update storage state, then make external calls. For withdrawals, clear the balance *before* sending Ether:

`balances[msg.sender] = 0;
withdrawalAmount = amount;
recipient.call{value: withdrawalAmount}();`

Mitigate reentrancy by following checks-effects-interactions: validate inputs, update storage state, then make external calls. For withdrawals, clear the balance before sending Ether:

`balances[msg.sender] = 0;
recipient.transfer(amount);`
